     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I was using shinyIncubator package for some servers I run for some time. However, I deployed new app and reinstalled shinyIncubator via:</div><div>sudo su - -c &quot;R -e \\&quot;devtools::install_github(&#39;shiny-incubator&#39;, &#39;rstudio&#39;)\\&quot;&quot;<br></div><div><br></div><div>After that all my apps, which were working before update, and the new one gives the following message:</div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\">ERROR: could not find function &quot;progressInit&quot;</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\">All apps, which were using shinyIncubator worked perfectly before.</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\">I understand that there is a problem with shinyIncubator, but I cannot solved it. I reinstall shiny, devtools and shinyIncubator again but nothing helps. </span><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\">Any ideas?</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\">Thanks,</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\">Adam</span></pre></div></div>"
